              </div>
              <div purpose="logo" class="calendly">
                <img alt="Calendly logo" src="/images/logos/logo-calendly-color-83x20@2x.png">
              </div>
              <div purpose="logo" class="mollie">
                <img alt="Mollie logo" src="/images/mollie-logo-136x40@2x.png">
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div purpose="logo-grid" class="d-flex d-sm-none">
            <div purpose="logo-row">
              <div purpose="logo" class="grafana">
                <img alt="Grafana Labs logo"  src="/images/logos/logo-grafana-labs-color-117x20@2x.png">
              </div>
              <div purpose="logo" class="nutanix">
                <img alt="Nutanix logo" src="/images/logos/logo-nutanix-color-93x12@2x.png">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div purpose="logo-row">
              <div purpose="logo" class="calendly">
                <img alt="Calendly logo" src="/images/logos/logo-calendly-color-83x20@2x.png">
              </div>
              <div purpose="logo" class="leidos">
                <img alt="Leidos logo"  src="/images/logos/logo-leidos-color-84x20@2x.png">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div purpose="logo-row">
              <div purpose="logo" class="mollie">
                <img alt="Mollie logo" src="/images/mollie-logo-136x40@2x.png">
              </div>
              <div purpose="logo" class="proton">
                <img alt="Proton logo" src="/images/logos/logo-proton-color-79x20@2x.png">
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div purpose="features-section">
        <div purpose="feature-with-image-row">
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <div purpose="feature-image">
              <img alt="Nothing hidden from the user" src="/images/nothing-hidden-600x338@2x.png">
            </div>
            <div purpose="image-caption">
              <h5>Nothing hidden from the user</h5>
              <p>Employees can see why Fleet is installed, inspect the open-source agent, and view the same device data IT sees, so managing Omarchy doesn't feel like being watched.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <div purpose="feature-image">
              <img alt="Vulnerability management your CISO will love" src="/images/vulnerability-detection-600x338@2x.png">
            </div>
            <div purpose="image-caption">
              <h5>Vulnerability management your CISO will love</h5>
              <p>Fleet matches installed packages and kernels against known vulnerability databases, including CISA KEV. See which devices are exposed and prioritize by exploit likelihood.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-with-image-row">
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <div purpose="feature-image">
              <img alt="Install required security agents and apps" src="/images/software-management-arch-600x338@2x.png">
            </div>
            <div purpose="image-caption">
              <h5>Install required security agents and apps</h5>
              <p>See what's installed on Omarchy hosts, including pacman packages. Install and remove software using custom scripts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <div purpose="feature-image">
              <img alt="Secure lost devices" src="/images/remote-wipe-omarchy-600x338@2x.png">
            </div>
            <div purpose="image-caption">
              <h5>Secure lost devices</h5>
              <p>Wipe an Omarchy device remotely, whether it's lost, stolen, or being decommissioned.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-with-image-row">
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <div purpose="feature-image">
              <img alt="Self-service for Omarchy" src="/images/self-service-for-linux-600x338@2x.png">
            </div>
            <div purpose="image-caption">
              <h5>Self-service for Omarchy</h5>
              <p>In regulated environments, Omarchy users can install approved software and handle common tasks from a self-service page in Fleet Desktop, without filing a ticket or waiting on IT.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <div purpose="feature-image">
              <img alt="Remote script execution" src="/images/remote-script-execution-600x338@2x.png">
            </div>
            <div purpose="image-caption">
              <h5>Remote script execution</h5>
              <p>Run shell and Python scripts on Omarchy devices, individually or in bulk. Automate configuration, fix issues, or collect diagnostics without interrupting end users.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div purpose="tweets-container" class="container-fluid px-md-0 pb-0 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
    <div purpose="section-heading" class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h1>What people are saying</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <scrollable-tweets :testimonials="testimonialsForScrollableTweets"></scrollable-tweets>

  <div purpose="bottom-gradient">
